<title>USA: Cave Creek USD 93, Ariz., $3.360 mln won by.</title>
<headline>Cave Creek USD 93, Ariz., $3.360 mln won by.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Shockey said it won $3.360 million of Cave Creek USD 93, Ariz., school improvement bonds project of 1997, Sereis B 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.304 percent.</p>
</text>
